  "description": "The Access WS C:62 SL is an unapologetically no-nonsense mile-munching trail explorer. Fast, light, nimble and responsive, the Fox 32 Performance fork with grippy, comfortable Schwalbe tyres and strong Magura MT8 Pro hydraulic disc brakes work together to ensure you're always in full control. Shimano's legendary XT 1x12 gears give you the ratios you need to tame any trail via a Praxis Girder Carbon crank, and a light and strong Newmen Evolution wheelset is the icing on the cake. It looks fast and - with you on board - it is fast.",
